<h2 id=gears>Gears</h2>

<p>A <dfn>gear</dfn> turns a gizmo.</p>

<p>A <dfn>cog</dfn> is a gear's tooth.</p>

<p>A <dfn>ratchet</dfn> lets a gear turn only one way.</p>
